      "given": "k₁ = 190 W/(m·K), k₂ = 335 W/(m·K), L₁ = L₂ = L, Total thickness = 2L.",
      "formula": "\\frac{2L}{k_{\\text{eq}} A} = \\frac{L}{k_1 A} + \\frac{L}{k_2 A} \\implies k_{\\text{eq}} = \\frac{2 k_1 k_2}{k_1 + k_2}",
